  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Opens a file of this File Storage for reading and writing. The file is opened with the seek position set to the beginning (corresponding to kAtThe Beginning). If the file does not exist, it is created. The file will be closed when the returned UniqueHandle goes out of scope.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
